    "sub": "An undergraduate astrophysics student at UC Berkeley has found three unusual galaxies, cataloged as Shapiro Dwarf Galaxies I, II and III. Each galaxy is far from other galaxies.",
    "sub_pt": "An undergraduate astrophysics student at UC Berkeley has found three unusual galaxies, cataloged as Shapiro Dwarf Galaxies I, II and III. Each galaxy is far from other galaxies.",
    "sub_en": "An undergraduate astrophysics student at UC Berkeley has found three unusual galaxies, cataloged as Shapiro Dwarf Galaxies I, II and III. Each galaxy is far from other galaxies.",
    "excerpt": "An undergraduate astrophysics student at UC Berkeley has found three unusual galaxies, cataloged as Shapiro Dwarf Galaxies I, II and III. Each galaxy is far from other galaxies and has stopped making stars, a combination that is extremely.",
