    "title": "NSF announces 3 additional topics as part of the NSF X-Labs initiative to pursue generational breakthrough science and technology efforts",
    "title_pt": "NSF announces 3 additional topics as part of the NSF X-Labs initiative to pursue generational breakthrough science and technology efforts",
    "title_en": "NSF announces 3 additional topics as part of the NSF X-Labs initiative to pursue generational breakthrough science and technology efforts",
    "sub": "NSF X-Labs invites proposals from teams working in AI for physical systems and announces two forthcoming topics.",
    "sub_pt": "NSF X-Labs invites proposals from teams working in AI for physical systems and announces two forthcoming topics.",
    "sub_en": "NSF X-Labs invites proposals from teams working in AI for physical systems and announces two forthcoming topics.",
